---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';
import Tui from './Tui.astro';
---

<Section
  id="monitor"
  title="See what every lane and unit costs, live."
  stacked
  more={{ href: '/docs/getting-started/#tui', label: 'The TUI in the docs' }}
>
  <p>
    Running <code>devlanes</code> opens a terminal view of every lane in the project, with the state
    of each service and its live output. The monitor adds CPU and memory per lane, per service and
    per container, with a minute of history, so you can tell which worktree is using the memory the
    next one would need.
  </p>
  <p>Open a unit to read its output, type into it, stop it or restart it.</p>
  <Terminal slot="visual" title="devlanes" class="terminal-tui">
    <Tui />
  </Terminal>
</Section>
